      "value": "HEMANGIOL is indicated in the treatment of proliferating infantile haemangioma requiring systemic therapy:<br/>• Life- or function-threatening haemangioma,<br/>• Ulcerated haemangioma with pain and/or lack of response to simple wound care measures,<br/>• Haemangioma with a risk of permanent scars or disfigurement.<br/>It is to be initiated in infants aged 5 weeks to 5 months"
